    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόρμος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hole</i> or <i>socket,</i> in
